# Tools
tools/*.exe
tools/*.o
!tools/scripts/
tools/*.py
# ...but the project's own toolchain is not a stray script. verify_functions.py
# is the judge this whole repo is built around and it was untracked; so were
# the reference builder, the SDK sweep, and everything added since. A blanket
# *.py silently excluded all of them.
!tools/scripts/*.py
tools/local
tools/ndstool/
!tools/PLACE_MWCCARM_HERE.md
!tools/PLACE_NDSTOOL_HERE.md
!tools/ndstool/README.md


# Built tools (can be regenerated)
ndstool


